==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn after 0.33 seconds<sup>10f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Count Owlbrow]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Count Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be challenging because of Count Owlbrow's high range and knockback + slow effect, but of the foes are [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]. Bring 2-3 meatshields, gather round all your [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]], and prepare to spam them. Some good choices include [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kotatsu Cat]], as their [[Massive Damage|massive damage]] and [[Resistant|resistant]] abilities respectively make this stage much easier. In fact, if you have their [[True Form]]s, this stage becomes a joke.

